# Rust build output
/target/

# Misc build output
*.o
*.a
*.dylib
*.dSYM/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Editor / IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# VM artifacts
*.image
*.snapshot

# GUI runtime scratch file (main.rs::display_html writes the D-G4-preprocessed
# page here before loadFileURL:; regenerated on every navigation)
/gui/.rendered/

# image_store's versioned SQLite database — regenerable from world/*.mst via
# `cargo run -p image_store --bin import_world` (docs/IMAGE.md); not source,
# and grows with live edits made through the GUI class browser.
/world/*.sqlite3
/dist/
.cog/
.dart/

# MacGamePane is a NESTED SIBLING REPOSITORY (its own history, its own
# remote: github.com/albanread/MacGamePane), not content of this one. It is
# macOS-only (Metal/AppKit) and deliberately outside the Windows workspace;
# gui/Cargo.toml's off-by-default `gamepane` feature documents how the mac
# side consumes it. Ignored here so `git status` stays clean without either
# flattening its history into ours or faking a submodule we don't need.
MacGamePane/
